    Today, we, the Conclave of the Damned, did something I'm sure all of us have been dreaming about since we started playing evil characters.  We raided the High Elf city of Felwithe.   It was a time for vengence as we avenge the deaths of countless Teir'Dal guards as well as Ogre Bouncers and Troll Bashers.  We didn't venture far inside, but I am confident that those goodie, goodie Elves felt our menacing presence.   I would like to extend a heartfelt thanks to Eeeks and Klub from The Dark Exile.  With the help of these two great warriors, our blades were able to cut deeper into the heart of the City.  Keep up the good work Conclave!!! <P>

Mistress Llara
Procurer of Flesh<br><br>
